1. Route Chosen 
• Starting Location (Initial State): L1 — Main Gate 
• Destination Location (Goal State): L4 — Science Laboratory 
• Graph Topology: 6 Nodes, 6 Undirected Weighted Edges representing physical 
distances in kilometers on campus. 
